   <li data-uuid=3D"def31de8-f6e1-433d-a994-c83704760711">Filtre de=C4=9Fi=
=C5=9Fince liste ilk sayfaya d=C3=B6ner; kay=C4=B1t say=C4=B1s=C4=B1 ve say=
falama yeniden hesaplan=C4=B1r.</li>
   <li data-uuid=3D"66459e98-399b-4c36-a0ce-bd5d12c6827c">Ekran ilk a=C3=A7=
=C4=B1ld=C4=B1=C4=9F=C4=B1nda b=C3=BCt=C3=BCn filtreler bo=C5=9Ftur (Hepsi)=
